                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "a cheap knock-off to the original hoplite on mobile\n\n1. the graphic is worse (kinda like a bad flash game). normally i wouldn't bother but this is my first impression of the game that kinda steal idea from another game but come out worse in any way\n\n2. there's no indicator at all. it didn't tell you any range of your range weapon and the effect of any abnormal status (what's the meaning of \"stun\"? how would i know how far i can throw it? and what's the radius?), it didn't tell you any enemy range (i would have no idea if i didn't play the original before, how am i suppose to know the enemy spearman's range? what about axe? etc.), it didn't tell you how to even use the most basic attack (frontal attack), it didn't tell you any info at all \n\n3. leave the enemy alive give you a penalty of not gain any exp (aka skill point). what's the point of that when the main idea is reached the last level? (so there's no room for creative/pacifist/challenge run which the original does)\n\ntl;dr just play the original on mobile. it is much better and free. i would refund this already if i didn't bought the key from the other site",
